  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "Partner workout: each partner buys in with a 56-second handstand hold or wall sit, then each completes 56 burpees, flutter kicks, walking lunges, hand-release push-ups and air squats before a shared 5,600 m run cash-out. Honours Chief Warrant Officers 2 Kirk Fuchigami and David Knadle, Apache pilots killed in a helicopter crash in Afghanistan in 2019. Solo athletes just do the whole thing.",
